$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Mass Frags" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Foggy with Rain" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Morning" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other at close range in the mass frags arena.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touch it to their own flag to capture it.  There are also 6 turret control stations spread throughout the map, each containing 3 switches. Each switch is worth 1 point to the team who controls it, and 5 points to the player who holds it. Each switch also brings vital turrets and items under your control. The first team with 50 flag captures or/and switches held shall be the victor!"@
	 "\n<f1>Map built by: <f0>[CoD]h0micide http://www.codx.com";